   000243         024300*    C O P Y B O O K   M C I W I N C B .            12 MAR 1997*  MCIWINCB                                   
   000244         024400****************************************************************     LV002                                   
   000245         024500*    PARAMETERS FOR CALLING THE 'MCIWIN' YEAR 2000 WINDOWING   *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000246         024600*    SUBPROGRAM.  MCIWIN IS USED TO CONVERT A 2-DIGIT YEAR     *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000247         024700*    INTO A 4-DIGIT CCYY USING A WINDOWING TECHNIQUE.  THE     *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000248         024800*    ONLY PARM MODIFIED BY MCIWIN IS "MCIWIN-RETURNED-YEAR".   *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000249         024900*                                                              *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000250         025000*    MOVE 50                     TO MCIWIN-NEW-WINDOW-YEAR     *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000251         025100*    MOVE MY-2DIGIT-YEAR         TO MCIWIN-YEAR-TO-WINDOW.     *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000252         025200*    CALL MCIWIN-PROGRAM USING MCIWIN-YEAR-TO-WINDOW AMODE(24) *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000253         025300*                              MCIWIN-RETURNED-YEAR            *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000254         025400*                              MCIWIN-NEW-WINDOW-YEAR.         *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000255         025500*    CALL MCWIN-PROGRAM USING MCIWIN-YEAR-TO-WINDOW  AMODE(31) *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000256         025600*                             MCIWIN-RETURNED-YEAR             *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000257         025700*                             MCIWIN-NEW-WINDOW-YEAR.          *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000258         025800*    IF RETURN-CODE IS GREATER THAN ZERO                       *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000259         025900*        PERFORM (SOME ERROR LOGIC)                            *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000260         026000*    ELSE                                                      *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000261         026100*        MOVE MCIWIN-RETURNED-YEAR TO ...                      *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000262         026200*                                                              *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000263         026300*    THE THIRD PARAMETER IS OPTIONAL.  IF NOT SUPPLIED, '50'   *     CL**2                                   
   000264         026400*    WILL BE USED AS THE "WINDOW", RESULTING IN A 100-YEAR     *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000265         026500*    PERIOD FROM 1950 THROUGH 2049 A.D.  IF A DIFFERENT WINDOW *     CL**2                                   
   000266         026600*    YEAR IS REQUIRED, IT MUST BE SUPPLIED ON EACH CALL TO     *  MCIWINCB                                   
