   000268         026800*                                                              *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000269         026900*    NOTE ALSO THAT MULTIPLE DATE FORMATS ARE ALLOWED UNDER    *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000270         027000*    MCIWIN-YEAR-TO-WINDOW, AND THAT MCIWIN-RETURNED-YEAR      *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000271         027100*    CONTAINS A ZONED DECIMAL 4-DIGIT YEAR IN CCYY FORMAT.     *  MCIWINCB                                   
   000272         027200*    USER MCIWIN-RET-CENTURY FOR THE 2-DIGIT CENTURY RETURNED. *  MCIWINCB                                   
